   "id": "the-fall-ended-a-decade-ago",
   "kind": "measured",
   "literals": [],
   "not_shown": "Why. Births, moves, school choice and Monty Tech all change this count and this file separates none of them. And it is one day a year: a child who arrives in November is not here.",
